二人で fu fu
together, fu fu,

406
00:42:06,257 --> 00:42:07,757
重ねて fu fu
intertwining, fu fu,

407
00:42:07,757 --> 00:42:12,757
そのまま溶け合えたら
melting into one just like this...

408
00:42:12,757 --> 00:42:15,257
さあ手を取って fu fu
Now taking your hand, fu fu,

409
00:42:15,257 --> 00:42:16,757
見つめて fu fu
gazing, fu fu,

410
00:42:16,757 --> 00:42:18,257
笑って fu fu
smiling, fu fu,

411
00:42:18,257 --> 00:42:21,257
あとはもうお気に召すまま
leave the rest as you please.

412
00:42:21,257 --> 00:42:22,757
さあ右から fu fu
Now from the right, fu fu,

413
00:42:22,757 --> 00:42:24,257
左から fu fu
from the left, fu fu,

414
00:42:24,257 --> 00:42:25,757
前方から fu fu
from ahead, fu fu,

415
00:42:25,757 --> 00:42:29,257
これが夢じゃなかったらタッタラ fu
if this wasn't a dream, tattala fu.

416
00:42:58,857 --> 00:43:00,257
せ〜の！ いち・に・さん・はい！
Ready, one, two, three, go!

417
00:43:00,257 --> 00:43:01,257
ほい！
Hoi!

418
00:43:03,757 --> 00:43:05,757
いよーーーっ、ぽん！
Yo----! Bon!

419
00:43:11,257 --> 00:43:13,757
これよりご覧いただきますのは カブキ者たちの栄枯盛衰
What you are about to witness is the rise and fall of kabuki performers.

420
00:43:13,757 --> 00:43:16,257
時代は常に日進月歩 聞いてってよ老若男女
Times are always changing, listen up, old and young, men and women.

421
00:43:16,257 --> 00:43:18,757
一見は勧善懲悪 悪者どもを一刀両断
At a glance, rewarding good and punishing evil, cutting down villains in one stroke.

422
00:43:18,757 --> 00:43:20,757
「でもホントにそれだけで楽しいの?」 もうなんだって紆余曲折
"But is it really that simple and fun?" Already full of twists and turns.

423
00:43:20,757 --> 00:43:23,257
どこからともなく現れて すぐどこかへ行っちゃって神出鬼没
Appearing out of nowhere and vanishing just as quickly, elusive as gods and ghosts.

424
00:43:23,257 --> 00:43:25,757
チャンスを待ったら一日千秋 追いかければ東奔西走
Waiting for a chance feels like a thousand autumns, chasing after it takes us far and wide.

425
00:43:27,257 --> 00:43:30,757
時代は常に千変万化 人の心は複雑怪奇
Times are always changing in a thousand ways, the human heart is complex and mysterious.

426
00:43:30,757 --> 00:43:32,757
「でも本気でそんなこと言ってんの?」 もうどうにも満身創痍
"But are you really serious about that?" Already battered and bruised all over.

427
00:43:32,757 --> 00:43:35,257
息呼、巡り巡って夜の街 キミは合図出し踊り出す
Ah, wandering round and round the night town, you give the signal and start to dance.

428
00:43:35,257 --> 00:43:37,257
はぁ?
Huh?

429
00:43:37,257 --> 00:43:42,257
回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ回レ!
Spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin!

430
00:43:42,257 --> 00:43:45,257
華用に花弁 散らすように 髪も振り乱して
Like scattering flower petals brilliantly, letting your hair fly wildly.

431
00:43:45,257 --> 00:43:48,257
一昨日、昨日、今日と、明日と、明後日と この宴は続く
Day before yesterday, yesterday, today, tomorrow, day after tomorrow, this banquet goes on.

432
00:43:48,257 --> 00:43:50,257
踊レ、歌エ、一心不乱に回レ! 今宵は雪月花
Dance, sing, spin with all your heart! Tonight is Setsugetsuka.

433
00:43:51,257 --> 00:43:53,757
この世に平安訪れるの? のべ幕無し丁丁発止
Can peace ever visit this world? A continuous, fierce clash.

434
00:43:53,757 --> 00:43:56,257
兵ども千客万来 ひしめき合う群雄割拠
Soldiers coming by the thousands, warlords vying for supremacy.

435
00:43:56,257 --> 00:43:58,257
伸びるか反るか一攫千金 気付いたら絶体絶命
Making it big or losing it all, before you know it, you're in a desperate plight.

436
00:43:58,257 --> 00:44:00,257
「でも本音のところ、どうなってんの?」 もうまったく奇想天外
"But what's the real truth behind it all?" Completely out of this world.

437
00:44:00,257 --> 00:44:03,257
息呼、辿り辿って夜の街 迷い一つなく踊り出す
Ah, wandering through the night town, you start dancing without a single hesitation.

438
00:44:03,257 --> 00:44:07,257
花で一つ、鳥で二つ 手打ち鳴らす
