along with Fubu-chan and Marine-senchou! This "Maware Setsugetsuka", um, 2 years ago in 2022,

483
00:48:37,078 --> 00:48:45,078
えっと、船長とふうちゃんと一緒にね、歌ってみたを出してまして
we released a cover version together with Senchou and Fubu-chan,

484
00:48:45,078 --> 00:48:55,078
